<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Charge Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 10
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> charge &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Headstrong and sometimes reckless, the Barbarian may attack without regard for their 
own safety. A charge is a hard blow that starts the fight: the higher your level, and 
the better your constitution and strength against your enemy's, the harder it hits. 
But it always costs you some hit points as well, about a tenth of what you have.
</p><p>You need some endurance left to charge. You can charge at another player only when 
both of you have signed the book of blood.
</p><p>Charging staffs and wands is something else: see <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Staff</a> and <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Wand</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Staff</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charge Wand</a>
</pre>




</div>